Before considering the task complete, verify:

### Visual

* Matches the designer screenshot closely.
* Correct typography.
* Correct colors.
* Correct spacing.
* Correct alignment.
* Correct sizing.
* Correct borders/radius/shadows.
* Correct images/icons.

### Responsive

* 1920px
* 1440px
* 1280px
* 1024px
* 768px
* 430px
* 390px
* 375px
* 320px

### Functional

* Existing interactions work.
* Existing navigation works.
* Existing API behavior works.
* Existing state behavior works.
* Existing forms work.
* Existing loading/error states work.

### Code

* No unnecessary files.
* No duplicate components.
* No unused imports.
* No unnecessary dependencies.
* No unrelated refactoring.
* No unnecessary CSS.
* No broken imports.

